# OPTIONAL. The site works without any environment variables: the platform address and organisation slug are
# built in (lib/site.ts, PLATFORM). Set these only to point at another API, e.g. staging.
# FastAdmission website -> Counsellor Platform
# API origin of the counsellor platform (NO /api/v1 at the end). Leads are posted to <this>/public/leads/webhook/<slug>.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=https://apicounsellor.jdinfotechsolutions.in
# Organisation slug of the FastAdmission tenant (tenant ID 00001) in the platform.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TENANT_SLUG=fastadmission
# Admin console (opened from /admin/leads)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_URL=https://counsellor.jdinfotechsolutions.in

# Poptin lead popup: nothing to add here. The site loads it from NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL for the organisation in
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TENANT_SLUG. Wording, timing and colours are set in the admin (Lead Engine, Poptin); the popup only
# appears on domains listed there (npm run setup:fastadmission adds fastadmission.in) and is off on /admin pages.
